Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.41,0:00:07.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:18.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:23.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:27.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:34.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:41.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:49.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:55.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:59.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:03.96,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:10.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:21.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第62话 高深莫测的阿椿咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:22.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:28.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:30.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么抵抗都是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖的成为妖怪的饵食吧 犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要不用铁碎牙就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:41.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种杂碎妖怪 单手就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴硬的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞刃血爪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.45,0:03:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要忘了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:18.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇的性命还在我的手上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:29.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题…没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 去帮助犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样戈薇会撑不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…椿不论犬夜叉赢或输
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都打算咒杀戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 非得切断椿的咒术不可
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:02.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打倒椿 或打倒咒术媒介的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇在倒下去之前曾说过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被不知名的东西咬了一口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 那可能就是黑巫女的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就是那条蛇没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 麻烦你掩护我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:35.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破魔符吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做无谓的挣扎了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢！我的咒术是不会破解的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞不清楚情况的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:05:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵抗只会延长戈薇的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:07.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说到不如
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就送戈薇上路算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.91,0:05:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:28.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚…我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吵…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.57,0:05:43.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪…谁在叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快点起床
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想睡到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:05:59.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:04.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会在这边的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡迷糊了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.83,0:06:10.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点起床了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要吃早餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连早安都不会说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是什么时候回到这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有去过什么地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.63,0:06:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那边的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:42.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五百年前过去的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是进入隐密的井里面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来到有很多妖怪的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:53.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进去过那口井里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是已经来回好几次了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:58.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连犬夜叉都有来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:06:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:01.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们连犬夜叉都忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里长着狗耳朵的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:13.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 今天向学校请假比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:19.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是睡迷糊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:33.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 快迟到了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:43.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前的事情 全部都是梦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点精神都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在烦恼什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是跟男朋友处的不好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:58.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了！你们还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:07:59.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个男生的事情对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:01.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 果然不是在作梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,B班的北条同学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是爱吃醋又粗鲁任性的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇你脚踏两条船吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇真有精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:32.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然还搞不懂状况
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是突然回到原来的生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着念下去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.85,0:08:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试快到了 别再发呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:59.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错…我必须要准备考试
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我原本的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是我的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:14.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我听说日暮同学没什么精神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个对身体很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:20.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踩踩看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:26.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是哪里不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:29.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得这样下去不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要很多小孩呢 讨厌啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:46.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶 买四魂之玉给我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:47.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起这个四魂之玉的由来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要从战国时代… 走吧 奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蚋 我觉得自己怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,许许多多的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在脑海里转来转去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好像有一件非做不可的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:50.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要回忆起来的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愈来愈模糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然一直有一种不可以再这样下去的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.59,0:11:07.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但到底是什么事非做不可
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:19.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时感受到的脖子的痛楚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:21.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也渐渐的习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:23.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,思绪也变的无法止息了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:34.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要焦急
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么觉得不安
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 抱歉 北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:52.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:58.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总算来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:05.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要试试看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为了这个而来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 那个标靶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.83,0:12:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好的瞄准
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:19.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,架式不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:30.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还早呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你的集中力不够
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:35.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问…请问你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:36.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:46.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.23,0:12:49.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又会丧命的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:53.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:56.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还无法离开这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是说这个的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:30.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界是你的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 回答我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:36.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:39.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:40.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:18.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么还能动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:22.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的集中力不够吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:26.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你已经能耐住咒缚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谣传你是桔梗转世
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:31.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎不全是唬人的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:35.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是真正的桔梗 刚才那一箭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:38.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该能确实的命中我才对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.01,0:14:41.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底你不过是桔梗的赝品
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:43.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这人真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:46.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.21,0:14:49.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是其他人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:14.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的家伙 这么急着找死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:25.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:51.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去 戈薇会支持不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 能再稍微撑一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会努力试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那两人大卸八块
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会让你被杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闪开 杂碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.41,0:16:29.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到此为止了 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死心吧 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:50.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.97,0:16:53.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这样就能切断咒术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:57.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒的效力还存在着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:05.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:07.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是杀了式神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你们几个也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妖怪在她的体内吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:34.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 留在戈薇的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,式神…该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕！这些妖怪全都是诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才发现太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,式神！咬断那女人的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:41.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:44.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会输给你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.03,0:18:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:02.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将式神打回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是咒术反噬！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.51,0:19:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和桔梗一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和那个时候一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会被这小丫头给…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉被净化了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:48.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片取出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.49,0:19:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:19:58.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她要逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.99,0:20:00.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:13.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样子好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.75,0:20:41.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片就那样给她？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:44.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么 马上就能取回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:47.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:52.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给黑巫女一个雪耻的机会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.76,0:20:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还蛮体贴的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:08.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耗尽力量了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:13.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饲养的妖怪统统死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.38,0:21:15.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明就只差一步
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只要有这颗四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能让我的力量更加强大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次我一定会打倒他们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好觉悟吧 犬夜叉 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇十分疲倦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:41.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是不得已的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她一直和咒术抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:47.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我在一起老是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.42,0:21:56.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我喜欢和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.76,0:21:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:21.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.02,0:22:28.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.79,0:22:34.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:41.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.07,0:22:48.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:55.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.85,0:23:02.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.82,0:23:08.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:15.79,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:22.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.88,0:23:29.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.62,0:23:35.52,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.14,0:23:52.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女椿还持有四魂碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:54.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么只有追过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.61,0:23:55.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.65,0:23:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿的同伴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.31,0:23:59.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红巫女与白巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:01.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是有够天真的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.65,0:24:02.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.65,0:24:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我骗了戈薇与弥勒他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.92,0:24:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻挡在前的红白巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得好好振作了
